# MD simulation — large trajectory files (generated on Colab)
data/md_simulation/*/trajectory/
data/md_simulation/*/*.xtc
data/md_simulation/*/*.trr
data/md_simulation/*/*.edr
data/md_simulation/*/*.cpt
data/md_simulation/*/*.tpr
data/md_simulation/*/*.gro
# Recursive guards: GROMACS outputs can nest deeper than one level (e.g. results/md_results_*/)
data/md_simulation/**/results/
data/md_simulation/**/*.xtc
data/md_simulation/**/*.trr
data/md_simulation/**/*.edr
data/md_simulation/**/*.cpt
data/md_simulation/**/*.tpr
data/md_simulation/**/*.gro
data/md_simulation/**/*.dcd
data/md_simulation/**/*.trj
!data/md_simulation/*/input/*.gro
data/database/*.bak_pre_fix1
